i[Re]ach gives people with little or no computer skills the opportunity to learn at[ their] own pace. Funded by the Worshipful Company of Information[ Techn]ologists, the workshop teaches practical digital skills,[ so] clients can access services and benefits online, and can also help to reduce social isolation.
