“We’ve spent a long time seeking out[ the right] charities for[ our] volunteers. People working in[ a professional] or corporate environment will tend to have digital skills[ they] can impart through sessions like i[Re]ach, which is a[ fantastic] project.
“We’ve really enjoyed working with Thames Reach and will continue to do[ so]. We’ve had 23 volunteers helping out with i[Re]ach. They share[ their] expertise and make[ contact] with people in[ their] communities[ they] might otherwise never have met,” she said.
