This[ hour] will[ feature] local Musicians from[ Ath]l[one]. We will discuss[ how] music plays[ a] key role in promoting Tolerance , Dialogue and Peace. This programme will be presented[ by] presenter/[Sound Engineer] with[ the station] and also a musician Cathal McCormack.
